# Owner decision 2026-11-15, an unrun command draft ("@question …", "@improve …"): ⌘⏎ runs it as ⏎ does; the focus
# leaving discards it; any other ⌘ shortcut discards it and goes on to the app.
NAME another cmd shortcut discards an unrun command draft and reaches the app
PROFILES all
LANG english
TEXT "Hi |"
TYPE "@improve ok"
EXPECT marked "improve › ok"   # a command draft shows as its name › its text
KEY cmd+a
EXPECT doc "[Hi ]"
EXPECT marked none
EXPECT panel hidden
